preConditionHook:
// EL: (close - low[1]) / (high[1] - low[1] + epsilon) > threshold, the short
// side against 1 - threshold. Where the close sits in the PRIOR bar's range,
// so a close outside that range gives a ratio above 1 or below 0 -- which the
// combined two-bar form (TwoBarRangePosition) can never produce, and which
// CloseRangePosition's own-bar ratio cannot either.
// The epsilon is an input at the corpus's usual 1e-06, following
// CloseRangePosition: an inside doji prior bar can have zero range and EL
// raises a runtime divide-by-zero on a zero denominator.
// No preconditions to compute; the ratio is written inline exactly as the EL
// twin writes it, so the two round identically.
